    metrics apply the web `?? 0` / `?? false` fallbacks; isConsuming = power>0.5, isRegen = power<-0.5.
    nodes [battery(left, level%), drive(right, |power|), charger(top, chargerPower)] shown to 1 decimal
    (web AnimatedNumber); drive label = Drive/Regen/Idle. arrows battery→drive (cyan, active=consuming),
    drive→battery (emerald, active=regen), charger→battery (amber, active=charging); value = active ?
    magnitude : 0; all three always emitted (inactive = thin static line). Stroke ∝ magnitude (1..4);
    compact keeps the 3 largest. VERIFIED by an EXECUTED harness (21/21) below.
  Composition → glass widget shell (Zap→`bolt.fill` cyan icon + "Energy Flow" title + freshness chip +
    refresh + optional Open) · EnergyFlowDiagram (Canvas-stroked arrows with marching-dash flow + node
